            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Qué sueles beber?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Que bois-tu habituellement ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What’s inside your drink?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was steckt in deinem Drink?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Qué contiene tu bebida?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Que contient ta boisson ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes, Log Drink": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja, Drink eintragen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sí, registrar bebida"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui, enregistrer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes, No Drink": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja, Kein Drink"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sí, sin bebida"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui, sans boisson"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already logged 'No Drink' today. Do you want to change and log a drink instead?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast heute bereits 'Kein Drink' eingetragen. Möchtest du stattdessen einen Drink eintragen?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoy ya registraste 'Sin bebida'. ¿Quieres cambiarlo y registrar una bebida?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as déjà indiqué 'Sans boisson' aujourd’hui. Veux-tu plutôt enregistrer une boisson ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already logged drinks today. Do you want to change to 'No Drink'? This will delete all drink logs for today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast heute bereits Drinks eingetragen. Möchtest du zu 'Kein Drink' wechseln? Dadurch werden alle Drink-Einträge von heute gelöscht."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoy ya registraste bebidas. ¿Quieres cambiarlo a 'Sin bebida'? Se eliminarán todos los registros de bebida de hoy."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as déjà enregistré des boissons aujourd’hui. Veux-tu passer à 'Sans boisson' ? Tous les journaux de boisson d’aujourd’hui seront supprimés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can only log one entry per day with the free version. Upgrade to Premium to log unlimited entries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In der kostenlosen Version kannst du nur einen Eintrag pro Tag speichern. Mit Premium kannst du unbegrenzt eintragen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con la versión gratis solo puedes registrar una entrada al día. Mejora a Premium para registrar entradas ilimitadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La version gratuite limite à une entrée par jour. Passe à Premium pour des entrées illimitées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You currently drink about %@ per week.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du trinkst aktuell etwa %@ pro Woche."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actualmente tomas unas %@ por semana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu bois actuellement environ %@ par semaine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're building momentum! Your body is starting to adjust to life without energy drinks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du baust Momentum auf! Dein Körper gewöhnt sich an ein Leben ohne Energy-Drinks."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estás cogiendo impulso. Tu cuerpo empieza a adaptarse a la vida sin bebidas energéticas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu prends de l’élan ! Ton corps commence à s’adapter à la vie sans boissons énergisantes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're on track to reach your 90-day goal by:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist auf Kurs, dein 90-Tage-Ziel zu erreichen bis:"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vas camino de alcanzar tu objetivo de 90 días el:"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu es sur la bonne voie pour atteindre ton objectif de 90 jours le :"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're over %d days in! The cravings may still come, but your mind is stronger, and your willpower is greater. Stay the course and trust the process.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist schon über %d Tage dabei! Verlangen kann noch kommen, aber dein Kopf ist stärker und dein Wille wächst. Bleib dran und vertrau dem Prozess."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya llevas más de %d días. Los antojos pueden volver, pero tu mente es más fuerte y tu voluntad crece. Sigue el camino y confía en el proceso."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
